<title>USA: Prudential wins $50 mln West Virginia Housing.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins $50 mln West Virginia Housing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $50 million of West Virginia Housing Development Fund bonds with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.848 percent.</p>
</text>
